  m_Text: Trash and Litter sadly affect the enviornment of the Everglades. Plastic
    bottles, cans and other forms of waste find their ways in both the land and waters
    of this ecosystem. This causes the various plants and animals that call the Everglades
    their home to suffer as a result with many dieing from injesting this waste or
    ending up trapped within it.
